      "description": "Manage test plans (/api/v2/{project_id}/plans). Select tests for the plan with \`tql\` (TQL); the API resolves matching tests. Call \`tql_help\` for the syntax and full field list. CLI-style: pass "command" plus the params it needs; each param description lists the commands it applies to.",
